{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcana Echo</strong> is a 2D puzzle game where you play as a young mage apprentice trapped inside an abandoned magic laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't run or jump \u2014 only think and cast. Discover ancient spellbooks to unlock new powers, like activating distant levers, levitating objects, and manipulating your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles based on classic physics elements like pressure plates, elevators, counterweights, and balance scales. Each room presents a new challenge, and each wing holds a different magical theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With silhouette art and a quiet, immersive atmosphere, <strong>Arcana Echo</strong> is a story of discovery, mystery, and the lingering echo of forgotten magic.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874990?t=1752780768","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874990?t=1752780768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874990/012c464f22d92c1a3d5d76310c76f7ba26374a47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752780768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874990/012c464f22d92c1a3d5d76310c76f7ba26374a47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752780768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcana Echo</strong> is a 2D puzzle game where you play as a young mage apprentice trapped inside an abandoned magic laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't run or jump \u2014 only think and cast. Discover ancient spellbooks to unlock new powers, like activating distant levers, levitating objects, and manipulating your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzle